        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 79.93,
          "end": 81.43,
          "en": "with a template literal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 81.43,
          "end": 83.26,
          "en": "and we use post slug,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 83.26,
          "end": 86.17,
          "en": "which is guaranteed to not have an extension,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 86.17,
          "end": 88.41,
          "en": "and add.md here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 88.41,
          "end": 90.7,
          "en": "So we always create a file, path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 90.7,
          "end": 93.41,
          "en": "or a file name with extension here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 93.41,
          "end": 96.14,
          "en": "And if we restructure our code like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 96.14,
          "end": 98.11,
          "en": "it should already work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 98.11,
          "end": 100.78,
          "en": "Now we can call, get post data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 100.78,
          "end": 103.43,
          "en": "with a file name, with an extension,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 103.43,
          "end": 105.8,
          "en": "or with just a slug.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 105.8,
          "end": 107.93,
          "en": "Therefore now we can export this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 107.93,
          "end": 109.18,
          "en": "to then use it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 109.18,
          "end": 111.84,
          "en": "in our single post page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 111.84,
          "end": 114.97,
          "en": "Because here, I wanna get a single post,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 114.97,
          "end": 117.13,
          "en": "for a given slug.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 117.13,
          "end": 119.63,
          "en": "Now for that, here in post detailed page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 119.63,
          "end": 121.723,
          "en": "I'll again export, a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 122.94,
          "end": 125.95,
          "en": "to get static props function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 125.95,
          "end": 127.39,
          "en": "Again for the same reasons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 127.39,
          "end": 128.37,
          "en": "as mentioned before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 128.37,
          "end": 131.08,
          "en": "get (indistinct) I props could be used here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 131.08,
          "end": 132.8,
          "en": "but isn't better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 132.8,
          "end": 136.15,
          "en": "And then here we get this, context object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 136.15,
          "end": 138.85,
          "en": "We get this in all get static props functions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 138.85,
          "end": 141.16,
          "en": "but we haven't needed it before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 141.16,
          "end": 142.48,
          "en": "Now we do need it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 142.48,
          "end": 147.48,
          "en": "because we can get our params, out of context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 147.57,
          "end": 149.47,
          "en": "That's what you also learned in the course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 149.47,
          "end": 151.53,
          "en": "Context has a params key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 151.53,
          "end": 155.09,
          "en": "and that's simply, is, then an object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 155.09,
          "end": 157.67000000000002,
          "en": "with the, concrete values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 157.67000000000002,
          "end": 159.18,
          "en": "of all the dynamic segments",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 159.18,
          "end": 160.94,
          "en": "that might lead to this file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 160.94,
          "end": 161.8,
          "en": "So in this case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 161.8,
          "end": 162.86,
          "en": "we'll be able to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 162.86,
          "end": 167.26,
          "en": "extract the concrete slug value, from params.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 167.26,
          "end": 169.35,
          "en": "Because we have that dynamic segment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 169.35,
          "end": 170.803,
          "en": "in this file name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 172.04,
          "end": 174.57999999999998,
          "en": "So here we then have to, slug,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 174.57999999999998,
          "end": 176.53300000000002,
          "en": "which we get from params.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 178,
          "end": 179.65,
          "en": "And now we can use that slug",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 179.65,
          "end": 182.03,
          "en": "to get the data for a single post,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 182.03,
          "end": 184.33,
          "en": "with get post data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 184.33,
          "end": 185.87,
          "en": "so importing that function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 185.87,
          "end": 189.22,
          "en": "from the lib folder into posts-util file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 189.22,
          "end": 192.05,
          "en": "and passing the slug as our argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 192.05,
          "end": 194.77,
          "en": "That will then give us the data, for that file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 194.77,
          "end": 197.42000000000002,
          "en": "it will read that data for that file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 197.42000000000002,
          "end": 199.51,
          "en": "and it's able to read that because,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 199.51,
          "end": 202.54,
          "en": "get static props executes during the build process,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 202.54,
          "end": 205.82,
          "en": "or on the server, not in the client.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 205.82,
          "end": 210.34,
          "en": "And then therefore we get our, post data here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 210.34,
          "end": 212.82,
          "en": "And hence we can then return our object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 212.82,
          "end": 214.53,
          "en": "as we always have,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 214.53,
          "end": 217.17000000000002,
          "en": "where we set the props for our component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 217.17000000000002,
          "end": 219.15,
          "en": "And here we can add the post prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 219.15,
          "end": 221.183,
          "en": "which holds that post data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 222.34,
          "end": 224.44,
          "en": "And here we could make a case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 224.44,
          "end": 226.91,
          "en": "for adding revalidate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 226.91,
          "end": 229.98,
          "en": "Here, we're not going through all the posts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 229.98,
          "end": 232.71,
          "en": "We're fetching the data for a single post.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 232.71,
          "end": 234.68,
          "en": "So this will be very fast.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 234.68,
          "end": 238.57999999999998,
          "en": "And if we set revalidate to let's say 600 here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 238.57999999999998,
          "end": 240.04,
          "en": "then we ensure,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 240.04,
          "end": 243,
          "en": "that if we ever updated a markdown file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 243,
          "end": 246.21,
          "en": "without rebuilding the entire application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 246.21,
          "end": 247.81,
          "en": "that then still,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 247.81,
          "end": 251.01,
          "en": "we do get that latest data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 251.01,
          "end": 253.89,
          "en": "at least once every 10 minutes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 253.89,
          "end": 254.78,
          "en": "So that we don't have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 254.78,
          "end": 257.19,
          "en": "to rebuild the entire application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 257.19,
          "end": 259.33,
          "en": "just because we fixed a typo",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 259.33,
          "end": 261.55,
          "en": "in one of our markdown files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 261.55,
          "end": 263.73,
          "en": "We could do this here, because here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 263.73,
          "end": 265.88,
          "en": "rebuilding after deployment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 265.88,
          "end": 268.22,
          "en": "will be much faster than if we do it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 268.22,
          "end": 269.7,
          "en": "for the other pages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 269.7,
          "end": 272.47,
          "en": "where we have to go through all the post files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 272.47,
          "end": 273.75,
          "en": "which takes a bit longer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 273.75,
          "end": 275.42,
          "en": "And therefor would slow down,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 275.42,
          "end": 276.67,
          "en": "some of the requests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 276.67,
          "end": 280.11,
          "en": "Here, it would not slow down the requests at all,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 280.11,
          "end": 281.92,
          "en": "or not by much at least.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 281.92,
          "end": 285,
          "en": "And we only do it once every 10 minutes anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 285,
          "end": 286.96,
          "en": "Of course you can tweak this duration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 286.96,
          "end": 289.43,
          "en": "to a duration that fits your needs though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 289.43,
          "end": 291.343,
          "en": "You can make it longer or shorter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 292.78,
          "end": 295.99,
          "en": "But with that, we now have get static props here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 295.99,
          "end": 298.76,
          "en": "However, since this is a dynamic page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 298.76,
          "end": 302.81,
          "en": "you'll learn that get static props can't work on its own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 302.81,
          "end": 304.44,
          "en": "We need to pair it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 304.44,
          "end": 306.6,
          "en": "with get static paths,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 306.6,
          "end": 308.44,
          "en": "to let Next know,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 308.44,
          "end": 313.083,
          "en": "which concrete slug values it should pre-generate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 313.98,
          "end": 314.93,
          "en": "And therefore we need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 314.93,
          "end": 317.46,
          "en": "to export another function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 317.46,
          "end": 321.733,
          "en": "We need to export the get static paths function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 323.07,
          "end": 326.02,
          "en": "This returns an object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 326.02,
          "end": 328.63,
          "en": "with all the paths that should be prepared.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 328.63,
          "end": 330.36,
          "en": "So with all the concrete values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 330.36,
          "end": 332.46,
          "en": "for a slug that should be prepared.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 332.46,
          "end": 335,
          "en": "And that's an array full of objects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 335,
          "end": 336.62,
          "en": "where we set params,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 336.62,
          "end": 338.23,
